autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ISS1n%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud7ab5ebf\" id=\"ud7ab5ebf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad70d07e\" id=\"uad70d07e\">观察这个函数声明</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2665959\" id=\"ub2665959\">static int bt_music_play_pause(void)，</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28436ea0\" id=\"u28436ea0\">我们发现它使用了static关键字修饰，这导致了这个函数只能在本文件中使用，如果我们想在其它文件中调用这个函数的话，我们需要删除前面的static关键字</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"epxgS\" id=\"epxgS\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67949f4d\" id=\"u67949f4d\">切换歌曲</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22bt_music_switch_song(FSEL_PREV_FILE)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E9%A6%96%5Cnbt_music_switch_song(FSEL_NEXT_FILE)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E9%A6%96%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QDyul%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"IZYtA\" id=\"IZYtA\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26910536\" id=\"u26910536\">歌词处理</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u36d66f37\" id=\"u36d66f37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3091e6fd\" id=\"u3091e6fd\">仔细观察歌词信息，我们会发现默认情况下是无法显示中文的，我们需要对歌词信息进行处理。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u13e3e968\" id=\"u13e3e968\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub18f28cb\" id=\"ub18f28cb\">例如我们播放英文歌曲，网易云音乐输出的歌词为： </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueed9bcf9\" id=\"ueed9bcf9\">你好你好^hellohello ,</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc91688c6\" id=\"uc91688c6\">中间用^分隔中文和英文，我们就可以用如下函数对歌词进行处理，只保留英文。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cnvoid%20split_music(char*%20music)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20separator%20%3D%20'%5E'%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%82%B9%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%20%3D%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(music%5Bi%5D%20!%3D%20separator%20%26%26%20music%5Bi%5D%20!%3D%20'%5C%5C0')%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20i%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20music%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20'%5C%5C0'%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ijv1B%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufa1b3b88\" id=\"ufa1b3b88\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7438f2e\" id=\"ua7438f2e\">如果我们的歌词不是上面这个格式，并且我们只想保留英文，我们也可以采取如下函数处理,只保留：英文字母、数字、空格、标点符号，其它字符用空格替换</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cctype.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstring.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20filterString(char%20*str)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20(int%20i%20%3D%200%3B%20str%5Bi%5D%20!%3D%20'%5C%5C0'%3B%20i%2B%2B)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%8B%B1%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E6%AF%8D%E3%80%81%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E3%80%81%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%81%E6%A0%87%E7%82%B9%E7%AC%A6%E5%8F%B7%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(!isalnum(str%5Bi%5D)%20%26%26%20str%5Bi%5D%20!%3D%20'%20'%20%26%26%20!ispunct(str%5Bi%5D))%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20str%5Bi%5D%20%3D%20'%20'%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vUPbS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"S9Lsq\" id=\"S9Lsq\"><br></h3><h2 data-lake-id=\"hSuui\" id=\"hSuui\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd16e694\" id=\"ubd16e694\">在LVGL中显示歌词</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ubd35e7bd\" id=\"ubd35e7bd\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1756275057544-f17dbf46-0709-4831-b295-b4f07fc08319.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u62bb9075-9ad3-4442-85ca-243f808dabd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u150f66a9-4b22-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A189.33333333333334%2C%22height%22%3A227%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A130572%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A284%2C%22originHeight%22%3A340%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDLWANTED%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKNOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A92%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLNYOURSC%22%2C%22x%22%3A124%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POWER%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A106%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A206%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23bfbfb9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud8201b00%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue5b173c6\" id=\"ue5b173c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5ec0542\" id=\"uf5ec0542\">我们需要创建两个label，一个用于显示歌名，另外一个用于显示歌词</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"moEzJ\" id=\"moEzJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81923eaa\" id=\"u81923eaa\">创建显示歌名Label</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22label_music_title%20%3D%20lv_label_create(lv_screen_active())%3B%5Cnlv_label_set_long_mode(label_music_title%2C%20LV_LABEL_LONG_SCROLL_CIRCULAR)%3B%5Cnlv_obj_set_style_text_font(label_music_title%2C%20%26lv_font_montserrat_22%2C%200)%3B%5Cnlv_label_set_text(label_music_title%2C%20%5C%22www.icheima.com%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Cnlv_obj_set_width(label_music_title%2C%20200)%3B%5Cnlv_obj_set_style_text_align(label_music_title%2C%20LV_TEXT_ALIGN_CENTER%2C%200)%3B%5Cnlv_obj_align(label_music_title%2C%20LV_ALIGN_CENTER%2C%200%2C%20-60)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CrRJW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"WEvwT\" id=\"WEvwT\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7e451bb\" id=\"ue7e451bb\">创建显示歌词Label</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22label_music_content%20%3D%20lv_label_create(lv_screen_active())%3B%5Cnlv_label_set_long_mode(label_music_content%2C%20LV_LABEL_LONG_WRAP)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%2F*Break%20the%20long%20lines*%2F%5Cnlv_obj_set_style_text_font(label_music_content%2C%20%26lv_font_montserrat_24%2C%200)%3B%5Cnlv_label_set_text(label_music_content%2C%20%5C%22www.icheima.com%5C%22)%3B%5Cnlv_obj_set_width(label_music_content%2C%20240)%3B%20%20%2F*Set%20smaller%20width%20to%20make%20the%20lines%20wrap*%2F%5Cnlv_obj_set_style_text_align(label_music_content%2C%20LV_TEXT_ALIGN_CENTER%2C%200)%3B%5Cnlv_obj_align(label_music_content%2C%20LV_ALIGN_CENTER%2C%200%2C%200)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pdziN%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"m25Uf\" id=\"m25Uf\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u323c92de\" id=\"u323c92de\">线程安全问题</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u85409187\" id=\"u85409187\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21e98cca\" id=\"u21e98cca\">LVGL默认是线程不安全的，在lvgl中</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud726aeb4\" id=\"ud726aeb4\">lv_task_handler()和lv_label_set_text()</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uafe1bbfa\" id=\"uafe1bbfa\">都会去刷新屏幕，而屏幕只有一块，所以存在资源抢占的问题，LVGL默认没有解决这类问题，这个时候就需要我们自己手工去解决这个问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4c63c2fa\" id=\"u4c63c2fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18767ce9\" id=\"u18767ce9\">解决的思路如下：</span></p><ol list=\"u9b18aea8\"><li fid=\"u9b37e347\" data-lake-id=\"u4ff3b361\" id=\"u4ff3b361\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48a512e4\" id=\"u48a512e4\">全局声明一把锁</span></li><li fid=\"u9b37e347\" data-lake-id=\"u698170fb\" id=\"u698170fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94e83ba5\" id=\"u94e83ba5\">调用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf07f352d\" id=\"uf07f352d\">lv_task_handler()</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue18c1f83\" id=\"ue18c1f83\">之前，需要先获取锁，再释放锁</span></li><li fid=\"u9b37e347\" data-lake-id=\"ucafd64a8\" id=\"ucafd64a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5fdb0e4\" id=\"ub5fdb0e4\">在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc3ae68b8\" id=\"uc3ae68b8\">其它修改UI的动作</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u661a4329\" id=\"u661a4329\">之前，先获取锁，再释放锁</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u12a80378\" id=\"u12a80378\"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"Su8Xm\" id=\"Su8Xm\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f22c816\" id=\"u7f22c816\">声明互斥锁</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ubebc64d3\" id=\"ubebc64d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u523f1a4d\" id=\"u523f1a4d\">在文件顶部声明一把锁</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SemaphoreHandle_t%20%5CtxMutex%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PFv6f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubf8c1e01\" id=\"ubf8c1e01\"><span data-lake-id=\"u249225bf\" id=\"u249225bf\">在lvgl_main_task对锁进行初始化</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20xMutex%20%3D%20xSemaphoreCreateMutex()%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gEG1H%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"RQcmj\" id=\"RQcmj\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u177be059\" id=\"u177be059\">修改lv_task_handler()</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22while%20(1)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if(pdTRUE%20%3D%3D%20xSemaphoreTake(xMutex%2CportMAX_DELAY))%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20u32%20time_till_next%20%3D%20lv_task_handler()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20xSemaphoreGive(xMutex)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(LV_DEF_REFR_PERIOD%20%3E%201%20%26%26%20time_till_next%20%3E%3D%201000%20%2F%20OS_TICKS_PER_SEC)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20msleep(time_till_next)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UcBzD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0ff10743\" id=\"u0ff10743\"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"NRE18\" id=\"NRE18\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32fbe63f\" id=\"u32fbe63f\">其它修改UI动作</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ub852ce6a\" id=\"ub852ce6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3a71007\" id=\"ue3a71007\">所谓其它修改UI动作指的是所有让屏幕显示发生变化的动作，例如文本内容变化了，图片变动了，显示时间变了等等，下面我们以歌名和歌词显示为例。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if(pdTRUE%20%3D%3D%20xSemaphoreTake(xMutex%2CportMAX_DELAY))%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_label_set_text(label_music_content%2C%20info)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20xSemaphoreGive(xMutex)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Luhg3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if(pdTRUE%20%3D%3D%20xSemaphoreTake(xMutex%2CportMAX_DELAY))%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_label_set_text(label_music_title%2C%20info)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20xSemaphoreGive(xMutex)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dKOM9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3ecd004e\" id=\"u3ecd004e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b970dd9\" id=\"u2b970dd9\">仔细观察上述两段代码，我们可以得出这样的规律，只要涉及到修改UI的动作，我们都需要给它加把互斥锁，这是因为屏幕只有一块，而很多任务都想去修改这块屏幕，我们就不得不利用互斥锁的机制来解决线程不安全的问题了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucd41cf15\" id=\"ucd41cf15\"><br></p>",
